WEBVTT

00:00:13.750 --> 00:00:16.120
Suicide?

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.410
That idiot...

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:18.410
Kei?

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:23.580
I'm sending you the info on this
Elbaji guy and his company.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.120
Cammy, I'm not seeing it.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:30.790
Don't you have something to say?

00:00:30.790 --> 00:00:32.080
Thank you.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:33.830
You're welcome.

00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.870
What happened to that Tilarna girl?

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:42.080
I haven't seen her...

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:44.580
Oh, she's in the sleeping room.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:47.250
She's in a new city. It's tiring her out.

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:50.580
So what's with the sword, then?

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:56.870
Sorry. I took my eyes off her
for a minute and she split.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.330
Bring her back. Now.

00:00:58.330 --> 00:01:00.250
I don't want people complaining
about the investigation.

00:01:06.870 --> 00:01:11.580
Fifteen years ago, a hyperspace gate
appeared in the middle of the Pacific.

00:01:11.580 --> 00:01:16.870
Beyond the gate lay a strange world
filled with fairies and monsters.

00:01:16.870 --> 00:01:19.200
Kariaena Island. The city of San-Teresa.

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:22.540
This city is Earth's "front door."

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:25.040
Over two million citizens
from both worlds live here.

00:01:25.040 --> 00:01:29.620
A mixture of different races and
diverse cultures, haves and have-nots...

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:33.040
The world's newest "city of dreams."

00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:37.410
But in the shadows of all this
chaos lurked countless crimes.

00:01:37.410 --> 00:01:39.080
Drugs. Prostitution.

00:01:39.080 --> 00:01:40.410
Weapons smuggling.

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:43.500
The San-Teresa Metropolitan Police maintained

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.290
a special unit to deal with these crimes.

00:03:30.200 --> 00:03:31.540
Well?

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:38.040
Without my help, you'd have been turned
away at the front door, Sister Tilarna.

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:41.000
Be grateful to the God of Earth.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:44.830
Does your "God" help with fake IDs?

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:48.700
I would've preferred
a more normal outfit, though.

00:03:48.700 --> 00:03:51.120
Don't let it look like it's bothering you.

00:03:51.120 --> 00:03:55.750
On Earth, high-ranking women walk like this.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:57.830
Now try it.

00:03:58.580 --> 00:04:00.120
Like this?

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:07.080
Hallelujah! Hallelujah!

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:11.330
Don't you think that's wonderful, Brother Kenny?

00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:12.540
Cute...

00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:23.000
I can't stand this stuff.

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.040
Play some damn disco music.

00:04:25.040 --> 00:04:27.250
This isn't that kind of place.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.910
This is far enough.

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.000
Here's your payment.

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:34.450
That was easy. Thank you.

00:04:34.450 --> 00:04:36.120
You sure about this, miss?

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:38.620
Isn't this important to you?

00:04:38.620 --> 00:04:41.250
My mother gave it to me.
But I don't need it anymore.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:42.540
But...

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:43.910
Thanks for everything.

00:04:46.620 --> 00:04:51.160
Okay, Brother.
Let's have some fun while we're here.

00:04:51.160 --> 00:04:56.160
But Father, she seemed like
something was really bothering her.

00:04:56.160 --> 00:04:58.200
Kids that age have a lot on their mind.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.160
Let her get some experience
with different things.

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:03.620
Like O, or V, or A.

00:05:03.620 --> 00:05:05.080
I'm worried...

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:14.040
Give me water.

00:05:15.290 --> 00:05:16.370
Water.

00:05:20.950 --> 00:05:23.660
Hey, having fun?

00:05:23.660 --> 00:05:26.040
--Get lost.
--Aww, lighten up.

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.500
You're a noble from the Tiburani area, right?

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.750
Surprised?

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:32.830
I'm from your world, too.

00:05:33.160 --> 00:05:36.410
Then why didn't you speak to me in Farbani?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.120
Apologies.

00:05:39.330 --> 00:05:43.870
I thought the language of the doreany
would be more suited for a place like this.

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.830
Speak as you like. I don't care.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:51.540
Really? Great, all that fancy
noble language tires me the hell out.

00:05:51.540 --> 00:05:53.040
Can we talk like this instead?

00:05:53.040 --> 00:05:54.660
Tell me what you want.

00:05:54.660 --> 00:05:55.870
I'm hitting on you.

00:05:55.870 --> 00:06:01.370
I love girls like you.
How about we go have a good time?

00:06:01.370 --> 00:06:04.540
I'm looking for someone. Bother somebody else.

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:07.160
Who are you after?

00:06:07.160 --> 00:06:11.330
Dennis Elbaji. The guy who runs this place.

00:06:11.330 --> 00:06:12.870
Oh, Dennis?

00:06:12.870 --> 00:06:15.000
Dennis... Dennis. Oh, Dennis!

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:19.750
Dennis Elbaji's a friend of mine.
Want an introduction?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:25.290
Don't make that face. Just come with me.

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:28.910
Now...

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:34.540
Actually, I'm Dennis Elbaji.

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:35.870
Surprised?

00:06:35.870 --> 00:06:36.910
Not really.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.080
Well, that's no fun.

00:06:39.080 --> 00:06:42.250
So, what do you want, miss?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.580
I am Tilarna Exedilica.

00:06:44.580 --> 00:06:47.700
I was sent here by the Knights of Mirvor.

00:06:47.700 --> 00:06:48.790
A knight, huh?

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:51.160
I know what you're up to.

00:06:51.160 --> 00:06:53.120
Give back the fairy.

00:06:53.120 --> 00:06:54.910
Oh, that?

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:58.330
No way. That's product.

00:06:58.330 --> 00:07:01.080
I thought you'd say that.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.290
You seem like you're ready to die, huh?

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:05.370
We're done talking, then.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:10.410
Incompetents.

00:07:12.660 --> 00:07:15.660
That's what happens when
you rely on doreany weapons.

00:07:15.660 --> 00:07:17.120
Agreed.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:21.250
Kids these days are just wimps.
It's a real problem!

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.040
I guess I should ask.

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.910
Who's your teacher?

00:07:25.910 --> 00:07:27.700
I have no intention of answering.

00:07:27.700 --> 00:07:28.910
I see.

00:07:33.580 --> 00:07:34.660
He's...

00:07:37.540 --> 00:07:41.000
I can see your panties, Tilarna.

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:45.160
I won't kill you yet.

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:47.870
I have lots of questions, after all.

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:59.660
This area hasn't been developed yet.

00:07:59.660 --> 00:08:02.910
There're still traces of the other world.

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.830
Nobody lives here anymore.
They all moved to the doreany town.

00:08:06.830 --> 00:08:11.200
Can't make a single dollar
raising crops, after all.

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.700
Do you know the name of Earth's god?

00:08:15.330 --> 00:08:16.450
"Money."

00:08:16.450 --> 00:08:18.580
Simplest thing in the world, right?

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.700
I've converted to its religion, too.

00:08:29.080 --> 00:08:32.120
I've been waiting for you, my master.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:34.620
Zelada, the goods are ready, right?

00:08:34.620 --> 00:08:37.450
Yes. If you'll follow me...

00:08:37.450 --> 00:08:39.450
Who is this lady?

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:40.870
One of the Knights of Mirvor.

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:43.250
She found my club somehow.

00:08:43.250 --> 00:08:45.410
Ask her all about it.

00:08:45.410 --> 00:08:46.790
Leave it to me.

00:08:46.790 --> 00:08:49.910
I'll make her tell you everything.

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:57.330
Now, Mr. Kareem, let's finish the deal.

00:09:00.080 --> 00:09:02.330
What a mess.

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:06.540
What's the situation?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.750
An old temple in the Hightails.

00:09:08.750 --> 00:09:11.410
Matched the records the delivery people had.

00:09:11.410 --> 00:09:12.870
Keep watching.

00:09:12.870 --> 00:09:15.000
SWAT's on their way.

00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:16.370
When will they get here?

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:17.620
Thirty minutes.

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:20.120
That long? Make them hurry!

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:21.540
Stay put.

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.080
We need to move up the schedule.

00:09:28.540 --> 00:09:31.450
I'm sorry. Please keep an eye on her.

00:09:31.450 --> 00:09:32.830
What about the questioning?

00:09:32.830 --> 00:09:35.160
I'll be right back.

00:09:52.910 --> 00:09:53.910
A fire?

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:00.200
Shit!

00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:08.000
Damn it, now I'm Don Quixote.

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:17.830
Arms of great strength.
Protection of the war god.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:21.580
Hey, you need to stay put!

00:10:30.870 --> 00:10:32.450
What are you doing?

00:10:33.620 --> 00:10:35.000
My job.

00:10:36.450 --> 00:10:39.540
I guess I'll say it.
This is the police. Throw down your--

00:10:41.790 --> 00:10:43.790
Yeah, thought so.

00:10:49.540 --> 00:10:51.500
Where's the fairy? Tell me!

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:16.370
How awful...

00:11:16.870 --> 00:11:20.000
It's worse for me.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:25.200
It takes cash to make
the drugs I turn them into.

00:11:25.200 --> 00:11:27.910
And then there was the investment
to make my new product.

00:11:27.910 --> 00:11:31.790
And now the place is going up in flames.
It's depressing.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.040
Shut up!

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:34.950
Oh, you mad?

00:11:34.950 --> 00:11:38.620
The fairies are holy and inviolable beings.

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:40.790
But you...

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:43.290
This is my new product.

00:11:44.290 --> 00:11:46.040
I can use a fairy as a medium

00:11:46.040 --> 00:11:51.160
to turn everyone within a few kilometers
into fairy dust addicts instantly.

00:11:51.160 --> 00:11:53.660
A psychic bomb, you could call it.

00:11:53.660 --> 00:11:56.290
I'm trying to come up
with a cooler name, though.

00:11:56.290 --> 00:11:58.120
That's terrifying...

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.870
You're no longer even human!

00:12:00.870 --> 00:12:04.120
Human... Human, huh?

00:12:04.120 --> 00:12:07.790
I grew up in the same world you did.
My family were warriors.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:09.450
Sword fighting. Mounted combat.

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:11.200
Etiquette. Magic.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:13.200
I was forced to master it all.

00:12:13.200 --> 00:12:16.450
Then I was gonna spend the rest of my life
being bossed around by incompetent nobles

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.450
before dying in some
stupid fight over territory.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:23.040
Thus ends a life lived with honor.
Disgusting, huh?

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.750
But Earth's different.

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:29.000
It's the American dream, you know!

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.160
Remember what I said? Money.

00:12:32.160 --> 00:12:36.370
With money, you can have whatever you want.
This place is much more human!

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:37.540
Shut up!

00:12:39.580 --> 00:12:43.700
So you're another one of the morons, huh?
That's a shame.

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:45.540
There'll be no holding back!

00:12:48.000 --> 00:12:49.580
Dance, dance!

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:55.830
Come on! A little more and
your boobs will come spilling out!

00:12:55.830 --> 00:12:57.830
If I only had my sword...

00:12:57.830 --> 00:12:58.830
Tilarna!

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:11.370
That stance. That sword. Vreideni style, huh?

00:13:11.370 --> 00:13:14.750
I told you. I'm not giving you a name.

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.250
This'll be fun!

00:13:16.250 --> 00:13:17.700
Want some help?

00:13:17.700 --> 00:13:20.250
No! I'll kill him myself!

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.910
Okay! Get him!

00:13:23.950 --> 00:13:25.040
My deepest thanks!

00:13:33.250 --> 00:13:34.540
You bitch...

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.120
I'll tell you before you die.

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:49.120
My teacher's name is Lord Garada Vreideni.

00:13:49.120 --> 00:13:52.290
Tell it to the demons in hell.

00:13:52.290 --> 00:13:54.250
Screw you...

00:13:58.660 --> 00:14:02.830
Nicely done. I would turned tail and run.

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:04.040
He was a scary dude.

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:05.910
He was a fierce enemy.

00:14:05.910 --> 00:14:08.790
What's with the outfit?

00:14:08.790 --> 00:14:10.620
D-Don't stare at me!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:12.410
It's not the kind of clothing I like!

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:15.290
Sure. Let's get out of here.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:17.410
Wait. She's still...

00:14:19.870 --> 00:14:20.910
A fake?

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:22.160
What?

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.790
It's just a doll.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:27.830
I don't sense any latena.

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:30.160
The real one is getting further away.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:31.870
So somebody took it?

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.910
Quiet. I can't concentrate.

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:38.200
Here.

00:14:42.000 --> 00:14:44.700
Those footprints are new.

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:50.200
That red wizard took the bomb
she was trapped in and fled.

00:14:50.200 --> 00:14:51.910
I'll explain on the way.

00:14:51.910 --> 00:14:53.000
Let's go, Kei.

00:14:54.120 --> 00:14:56.250
A psychic bomb, huh?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.950
I don't know if I understand the particulars,

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.500
but that explains what happens
to the guys from Precinct 22.

00:15:01.500 --> 00:15:04.330
That wizard, Zelada, took it.

00:15:04.330 --> 00:15:06.250
If he uses it, the results will be horrific.

00:15:06.250 --> 00:15:09.870
Tens of thousands of people
turned into addicts in an instant.

00:15:09.870 --> 00:15:13.160
And he can make them do
whatever he wants, huh?

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:15.660
Quiet. She's very close.

00:15:23.290 --> 00:15:24.290
Stop!

00:15:25.040 --> 00:15:27.790
Hands up. Slowly.

00:15:29.700 --> 00:15:34.080
Oh, you're the undercover
cop from the other day.

00:15:34.080 --> 00:15:35.500
Hello, there...

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:36.750
Careful, Kei!

00:15:38.700 --> 00:15:42.750
You're gonna pay for what you did to Rick.
You're spending the rest of your life in jail.

00:15:42.750 --> 00:15:45.370
How could you do that to an old man?

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:47.750
Show a little mercy.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:51.000
Shut up. You're under arrest.

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:53.660
Matoba, looks like you caught the guy.

00:15:55.160 --> 00:15:56.370
Chief?

00:15:57.200 --> 00:16:00.290
SWAT's cleaning up.

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:04.080
They caught the terrorists
who were buying the bomb, too.

00:16:04.080 --> 00:16:07.910
Good to hear. But why are you here?

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:09.250
This is why.

00:16:10.870 --> 00:16:13.200
Don't move.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.830
Let him go.

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.580
Use my car.

00:16:19.580 --> 00:16:21.540
My deepest thanks, Sir Roth...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:22.540
Wait!

00:16:24.040 --> 00:16:25.870
Throw down the gun, Matoba.

00:16:25.870 --> 00:16:27.200
Chief...

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.580
Do it.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:36.160
Oh, right... Sir Matoba, was it?

00:16:36.160 --> 00:16:38.450
You've grown so handsome.

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:42.080
I barely recognized you from
the time we met in that swamp.

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.620
It was you?

00:16:48.620 --> 00:16:49.910
It was you, wasn't it?

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:53.080
You wiped out my unit during the war!

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.200
Have a lovely evening.

00:16:56.450 --> 00:16:58.250
Don't move, Matoba.

00:16:58.250 --> 00:17:01.040
He killed Rick!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:05.620
Were you the one informing him
about the investigation?

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.160
Yeah. It was all me.

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:12.790
I'm the one who gave you an inexperienced
Semanian to slow you down.

00:17:12.790 --> 00:17:16.120
The one who had an assassin sent after Alvarez.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:20.120
And told Zelada that the temple
hideout had been found.

00:17:20.120 --> 00:17:21.870
And killed Rick, too?

00:17:23.160 --> 00:17:24.950
Answer me!

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:27.250
Fury had almost found me out.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.330
I couldn't help it.

00:17:30.950 --> 00:17:32.250
I don't get it...

00:17:32.250 --> 00:17:34.620
Roth, you of all people...

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:35.950
Why?

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.830
He and I want the same thing.

00:17:37.830 --> 00:17:42.330
That man, Zelada, hates Earth's civilization.

00:17:42.330 --> 00:17:46.160
He wants terrorism to sow hatred
between Earth and the Semanians.

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:49.040
And so do I.

00:17:49.040 --> 00:17:53.120
Coexistence and peace
are lies the idealists tell.

00:17:53.120 --> 00:17:55.660
We can never understand each other.

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.540
We have to be separated.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:18:00.450
Some people are adapting just fine.

00:18:00.450 --> 00:18:03.830
And their ability to adapt is what scares me!

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:06.450
Look at their vitality.

00:18:06.450 --> 00:18:11.040
Three generations from now,
they'll be ruling the Earth!

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.500
The invasion will be over
before anybody realizes...

00:18:13.500 --> 00:18:18.410
Yes... Even the invaders
don't know they're doing it!

00:18:20.450 --> 00:18:24.000
The world needs to know
how dangerous they are.

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:28.910
And that psychic bomb can make them afraid

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:33.120
without damaging the infrastructure of society.

00:18:33.120 --> 00:18:36.910
And you call yourself a police officer?

00:18:36.910 --> 00:18:41.580
An officer? But more importantly,
I'm a human living on Earth.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:47.620
Kei Matoba, I thought you might understand.

00:18:47.620 --> 00:18:50.790
You want me to join you? Screw you.

00:18:50.790 --> 00:18:52.750
I'm sorry to hear that.

00:18:52.750 --> 00:18:55.910
You always hide a revolver at your ankle, right?

00:18:55.910 --> 00:18:57.500
Give it a try, if you want.

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:26.700
You were like a dad to me.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:27.870
I see.

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:31.290
I'm sorry.

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.790
Kei...

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:38.290
No, I'm fine.

00:19:38.290 --> 00:19:39.750
I'm amazed you survived.

00:19:42.120 --> 00:19:43.450
I can't believe it.

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:44.540
Neither can I.

00:19:48.580 --> 00:19:50.080
Let's follow him.

00:19:50.080 --> 00:19:51.330
Zelada?

00:19:51.330 --> 00:19:53.910
He's gonna use that bomb. And right now, too.

00:19:56.950 --> 00:20:00.950
We found the chief's car.
Forest Tower, in Queen's Valley.

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:02.790
Thanks.

00:20:02.790 --> 00:20:05.580
Kei. About the chief...

00:20:05.580 --> 00:20:08.120
We'll talk later.
Get some officers there.

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:13.290
Forest Tower is one of the
tallest buildings in the city.

00:20:13.290 --> 00:20:15.500
He's going to use the psychic bomb there?

00:20:15.500 --> 00:20:19.200
It may be more effective
there than on the ground.

00:20:19.200 --> 00:20:20.330
I see.

00:20:20.330 --> 00:20:23.000
Just like a nuke, huh?

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:24.500
What's this place like?

00:20:24.500 --> 00:20:28.790
Loaded with rich folks.
Common folk never go there.

00:20:28.790 --> 00:20:31.870
Maybe it's not even worth stopping him.

00:20:33.370 --> 00:20:35.700
I know. It was a joke.

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:36.870
Good, then.

00:20:38.000 --> 00:20:38.830
Kei.

00:20:38.830 --> 00:20:40.250
What?

00:20:40.250 --> 00:20:43.700
That wizard... Zelada... You know him?

00:20:45.540 --> 00:20:49.080
Who knows? To me, he's just another perp.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.660
It's that wizard Zelada's doing.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:00.750
Above!

00:21:01.870 --> 00:21:03.370
Is he dangerous?

00:21:03.370 --> 00:21:05.790
A wizard's power is something to be feared.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:08.660
They can blind a warrior
or create poisonous flames.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:10.830
Your weapons are no match...

00:21:10.830 --> 00:21:14.450
Even this thing? It's a good gun,
and I've been using it for a long time.

00:21:14.450 --> 00:21:17.790
Your doreany weapons have no soul.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:23.160
No... I feel a faint latena from this gun.

00:21:24.250 --> 00:21:27.790
Feelings put into an object,
no matter what it is, will create latena.

00:21:34.620 --> 00:21:39.500
Stay close to me, Kei. I'm the only one
who can spot the enemy's ambush.

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:40.950
But...

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:43.160
If you're my partner, trust me.

00:21:44.950 --> 00:21:46.160
Got it.

00:21:49.330 --> 00:21:50.370
Get back!

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.290
Ahead! Run!

00:21:55.330 --> 00:21:58.700
That fire will burn your lungs.
You won't be able to breathe...

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:01.040
So you'll choke to death, huh? Damn.

00:22:02.120 --> 00:22:03.250
That's her!

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:07.750
Leahyah!

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:42.750
"Next time"

00:23:42.750 --> 00:23:44.620
Next time on <i>COP CRAFT.</i>
